#: fc870aec18fe48538b949d2617f90a3a
msgid "ADS-B"
msgstr "ADS-B"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:8
#: 3210506e6d264e9eb5c0596a6cb0eb66 c071e964fc6c4b6187fe3845f991fcde
#: c66af7dd1a4b4f9dbd74c2638741383a
msgid ""
"This article describes how to attach and configure an ADS-B module so that "
"your aircraft can be aware of, and/or transmit to, other aircraft and air-"
"traffic control nearby. This also allows the pilot on the ground to be aware"
" of nearby manned aircraft and optionally to allow the vehicle to "
"automatically avoid them."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何连接和配置 ADS-B "
"模块，使飞行器能够感知附近其他飞机和空中交通管制，以及向其发送信息。这也使地面飞手能够感知附近有人机，并可选择允许飞行器自动规避。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:13
#: 092c6010786f439182bac71f26ed88f0 4b21e58283644236bc08107553bf56e8
#: 525f47369b5c4525b2b5317860caa8f6
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"ADS-B (aka `Automatic Dependent Surveillance Broadcast "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automatic_dependent_surveillance_%E2%80%93_broadcast>`__)"
" is an air traffic surveillance technology that enables aircraft to be "
"accurately tracked by air traffic controllers and other pilots without the "
"need for conventional radar."
msgstr ""
"ADS-B（即 `广播式自动相关监视 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automatic_dependent_surveillance_%E2%80%93_broadcast>`__）是一种空中交通监视技术，无需传统雷达即可使空中交通管制员和其他飞行员精确追踪飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:18
#: 5cf454e00a934ca8bdc66ff61d73ae4c cb145830260d442798141761123195c7
#: e6eb9ddbe1d9488fa09197e2fbb73a29
msgid ""
"The avoidance features are new features still under development and should "
"be used with caution. It is highly recommended that the RCx_OPTION =38 (ADSB"
" Avoidance En) feature be setup if ADSB avoidance is enabled to allow easy "
"disabling while airborne, if so desired."
msgstr ""
"规避功能属于仍在开发中的新功能，应谨慎使用。如果启用了 ADSB 规避，强烈建议设置 RCx_OPTION = 38（ADSB Avoidance "
"En）功能，以便在需要时可在飞行中轻松禁用。"

