"capable of transmitting. You will be showing up on air-traffic controller "
"airport radar!"
msgstr "请确保您拥有使用能够发射的 ADSB 硬件的合法许可。您将出现在空中交通管制的机场雷达上！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:88
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:89
#: a5373ff648d94e9e9eb04c2306646312 a9fb906fa3b14d179f84cbc688841fed
#: f179e0380d454dd0956cde861bb15eaa
msgid "The following parameters are used to configure ADS-B out:"
msgstr "以下参数用于配置 ADS-B 发射："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:90
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:91
#: 2be83cc6b0cf49449e3750c4d1337e1b ca477716926544dda02786e91c1230fb
#: fc6347b805ca4a0686b65e50adc3761b
msgid ""
":ref:`ADSB_ICAO_ID <ADSB_ICAO_ID>`: ICAO_ID unique vehicle identification "
"number of this aircraft. This is a integer limited to 24bits. If set to 0 "
"then one will be randomly generated. If set to -1 then static information is"
" not sent, transceiver is assumed pre-programmed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ADSB_ICAO_ID <ADSB_ICAO_ID>`：ICAO_ID，该飞行器的唯一标识号。这是一个限制在 24 位的整数。设为 0 "
"时随机生成，设为 -1 时不发送静态信息，假定收发机已预先编程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:91
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:92
#: 4ee94a6ca0004b36964c751b98a99131 571be99d4c544339a892c213f416b616
#: ef3e016abba64fa29940848b37d385a2
msgid ""
":ref:`ADSB_EMIT_TYPE <ADSB_EMIT_TYPE>`: ADSB classification for the type of "
"vehicle emitting the transponder signal. Default value is 14 (UAV)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ADSB_EMIT_TYPE <ADSB_EMIT_TYPE>`：发射应答器信号的飞行器类型的 ADSB 分类。默认值为 14（UAV）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:92
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:93
#: 169bde3dcfd042b9b6d565b1be50fbcd aa7259af970b454abe33502d4e36f829
#: d0114de666f448ca97cea5b0a96bee8d
msgid ""
":ref:`ADSB_LEN_WIDTH <ADSB_LEN_WIDTH>`: Aircraft length and width dimension "
"options in Length and Width in meters. In most cases, use a value of 1 for "
"smallest size."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ADSB_LEN_WIDTH <ADSB_LEN_WIDTH>`：飞行器长度和宽度尺寸选项（单位：米）。大多数情况下，使用 1 "
"表示最小尺寸。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:93
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:94
#: d854febe05eb4d9ab8e496359c4f3279 ebb1ab236be749448387d631be5b37d2
#: eece9fd14acc46a98902d6c64c7eef92
msgid ""
":ref:`ADSB_OFFSET_LAT <ADSB_OFFSET_LAT>`: GPS antenna lateral offset. This "
"describes the physical location offset from center of the GPS antenna on the"
" aircraft."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ADSB_OFFSET_LAT <ADSB_OFFSET_LAT>`：GPS 天线横向偏移量。描述 GPS "
"天线在飞行器上相对于中心的物理位置偏移。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:94
