#: dbbae5cd69bf43e094879d7a92ed445d
msgid ""
":ref:`ADSB_OFFSET_LON <ADSB_OFFSET_LON>`: GPS antenna longitudinal offset. "
"This is usually set to 1, Applied By Sensor"
msgstr ":ref:`ADSB_OFFSET_LON <ADSB_OFFSET_LON>`：GPS 天线纵向偏移量。通常设为 1，由传感器应用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:95
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:96
#: 3bf96c4e4bca45468ac1c36fd1d1690d b55d87b3b2b64738ae54e160b67f6248
#: b6228770b4754e569a340c0c48f357cc
msgid ""
":ref:`ADSB_RF_SELECT <ADSB_RF_SELECT>`: Transceiver RF selection for Rx "
"enable and/or Tx enable. This only effects devices that can Tx and/or Rx. "
"Rx-only devices override this to always be Rx-only."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ADSB_RF_SELECT <ADSB_RF_SELECT>`：收发机 RF "
"选择，用于启用接收和/或发射。仅影响具备发射/接收能力的设备。仅接收设备会覆盖此设置，始终处于仅接收模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:96
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:97
#: 7c5c3b048fd141f88eb151fe7f9930d7 a6682715f1fd405a858291f4a46eb3bf
#: dca5fd627e264ab2b814339a0b5369a2
msgid ""
":ref:`ADSB_SQUAWK <ADSB_SQUAWK>`: Squawk/Transponder (Mode 3/A) code that is"
" broadcasted to ATC that is usually assigned by your ATC for a given flight."
" In the USA/Canada the default squawk code is for VFR which is 1200. Most "
"parts of Europe and Australia use 7000. If an invalid octal number is set "
"then it will be reset to 1200."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ADSB_SQUAWK <ADSB_SQUAWK>`：应答码（Mode 3/A），向 ATC 广播，通常由 ATC "
"为特定飞行分配。美国/加拿大目视飞行规则默认应答码为 1200，欧洲和澳大利亚大部分地区使用 7000。若设置了无效的八进制数则重置为 1200。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:97
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:98
#: 143bb3c71da64d52b085df4e8b65bd45 ab416cdbcf1f48a7a5f5ca8f176d9c98
#: e9003eb7169948d8ba9cc70263e7026b
msgid ""
":ref:`ADSB_OPTIONS <ADSB_OPTIONS>`: Allows enabling certain device specific "
"capabilities and to allow \"Squawking\" emergency codes on certain vehicle "
"failsafes."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ADSB_OPTIONS <ADSB_OPTIONS>`：允许启用特定设备功能，并在某些飞行器失控保护时允许「紧急应答码广播」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:100
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:99
#: 420e8438c6564af78c213b366d33f44e b55403ce27a8456aa5347edbf9498caa
#: c309fd6b0cd74084a3f70e7d5ba7a367
msgid ""
"In many cases the defaults are OK and you don't need to change any of these "
"except :ref:`ADSB_RF_SELECT <ADSB_RF_SELECT>` which is needed to turn on the"
" transmitter. The :ref:`ADSB_RF_SELECT<ADSB_RF_SELECT>` transmit bit is "
"cleared on boot to ensure you're only trsnamitting when intentionally "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"在许多情况下，默认值即可，除了 :ref:`ADSB_RF_SELECT <ADSB_RF_SELECT>` "
"需要设置以开启发射器。:ref:`ADSB_RF_SELECT<ADSB_RF_SELECT>` 的发射位在启动时被清除，以确保仅在有意启用时才发射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:101
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:102
#: 05afd9baf9a94cbfb5f9b9e3db61bfa5 6969b303c31f431fa2dcf9dd5cabff13
#: d5b022ee12724d2e9fb55bc9d659a06c
msgid ""
"There are additional MAVLink messages for ADSB in uavionix.xml to allow a "
"GCS to set all of these options. Namely, msg UAVIONIX_ADSB_OUT_CFG and "
"UAVIONIX_ADSB_OUT_DYNAMIC where the _cfg is the only place where you can "
"assign a custom callsign."
msgstr ""
"uavionix.xml 中还有额外的 MAVLink 消息用于 ADSB，允许地面站设置所有这些选项。即消息 "
"UAVIONIX_ADSB_OUT_CFG 和 UAVIONIX_ADSB_OUT_DYNAMIC，其中 _cfg 是唯一可以指定自定义呼号的地方。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:103
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:104
#: 8adeff6bfb054e409dd2761e2dea29c2 e6df45cda75f4348a289e6bf5c625bbd
#: e7ba897f6e0c4e5fa06f81db99ddff22
msgid ""
"Mission Planner's transponder tab will not send correct messages to "
"Sagetech's XP series transponders. In order to change operating mode, "
"Sagetech's Engineering GUI can be used to set the transponder to ALT mode to"
" ensure transmission is working with the flight controller."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 的应答器标签页不会向 Sagetech XP 系列应答器发送正确的消息。如需更改工作模式，可使用 Sagetech "
"的工程 GUI 将应答器设置为 ALT 模式，以确认发射功能与飞控正常配合。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:106
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:107
#: 1c17399a2d5740e4b3ae134832770665 4edf4a4ce30b4db9989e557a5b0f26ae
#: 566988964b264329ab532505d6931cfe
msgid "Enabling Manned Vehicle Avoidance"
msgstr "启用有人机规避"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:108
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:109
#: 0beac7a6fe534a5996f9f08e0ca9d6f7 a13ee4179f184ea793473531815dc1cd
#: bcfd6de1491b4adf85a2608ee19a07f8
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes a flight mode, AVOID_ADSB, that attempts to avoid manned "
"vehicles based on the ADS-B sensor's output. Entry into this mode is "
"automatic when avoidance is necessary based on the parameters below. Exit is"
" also automatic when the threat has passed."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 包含一种飞行模式 AVOID_ADSB，可根据 ADS-B "
"传感器输出自动规避有人机。当基于以下参数判断需要规避时，自动进入该模式；威胁解除后自动退出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:110
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:111
#: 1530e725f6eb4cf596d9793c3f79173b 5794cade2dd343798cb65f1e9847274f
#: e6ecafc55afd4a20b578397cd69d324c
msgid ""
"To enable this feature connect with a Ground Station and set the following "
"parameters:"
msgstr "要启用此功能，请连接地面站并设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:112
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:113
#: bbb95b35ad534434b43315427d301324 bcfb08d7b2364bdca62b960c00d90783
#: dac9c5f59726492d8af535f8a3a0661d
msgid ""
":ref:`AVD_ENABLE <AVD_ENABLE>`: set to \"1\" to enable ADS-B based avoidance"
" (param refresh may be necessary after setting this)"
msgstr ":ref:`AVD_ENABLE <AVD_ENABLE>`：设为「1」以启用基于 ADS-B 的规避（设置后可能需要刷新参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:113
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:114
#: 1087b8c01da8451d89c67353fda1f633 ac3253d1c67644d18bc49618d0b3d588
#: e01f3b08d7ee48038c930baefd551be1
msgid ""
":ref:`AVD_F_DIST_XY <AVD_F_DIST_XY>`: the horizontal distance in meters that"
" should be considered a near-miss"
msgstr ":ref:`AVD_F_DIST_XY <AVD_F_DIST_XY>`：应被视为近距相遇的水平距离（单位：米）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:114
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:115
#: 0811826777f54fa6bbe56eebb5813541 c2ea36c0d94640f0a322e94332c83d69
#: d64311b125be4f19849d4f9c4098d9ac
msgid ""
":ref:`AVD_F_DIST_Z <AVD_F_DIST_Z>`: the vertical distance in meters above or"
" below the vehicle that should be considered a near-miss"
msgstr ":ref:`AVD_F_DIST_Z <AVD_F_DIST_Z>`：飞行器上方或下方应被视为近距相遇的垂直距离（单位：米）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:115
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:116
#: 0f1a4fd226e24ad197b0669ee82068a8 3ebb5f13b56644a3b2c3bb73bfc19e38
#: af59c3af56f24f05906be0cad7a616bc
msgid ""
":ref:`AVD_F_TIME <AVD_F_TIME>`: how many seconds in advance of a projected "
"near-miss (based on the vehicle's current position and velocity) the vehicle"
" should begin the ``AVD_F_ACTION``."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AVD_F_TIME <AVD_F_TIME>`：根据飞行器当前位置和速度预测将在多少秒后发生近距相遇，开始执行 "
"``AVD_F_ACTION``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:116
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:117
#: 1ae1f0e66b85487885a6a026e24738d3 55a71e536e74466db692c775fb2208e1
#: 6669535d49394895ba8c3cbe142cb99b
msgid ""
":ref:`AVD_F_ACTION <AVD_F_ACTION>`: controls how the vehicle should respond "
"to a projected near-miss (i.e. 2:Climb Or Descend, 3:Move Horizontally, "
"4:Move Perpendicularly in 3D, 5:RTL or 6:Hover)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`AVD_F_ACTION <AVD_F_ACTION>`：控制飞行器对预测近距相遇的响应方式（如 "
"2：爬升或下降，3：水平移动，4：三维垂直移动，5：RTL，6：悬停）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:117
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:118
#: 35914c2c077d4721b6aa807fea780b64 ae6bb72d12364cf58bc0f93894f47945
#: efa73b3d2f064b63bfd9b3e5252ccb83
msgid ""
":ref:`AVD_F_RCVRY <AVD_F_RCVRY>`: sets how the vehicle will behave after the"
" vehicle has cleared the near-miss area (i.e. 1 = resume previous flight "
"mode)"
msgstr ":ref:`AVD_F_RCVRY <AVD_F_RCVRY>`：设置飞行器离开近距相遇区域后的行为（如 1 = 恢复前一飞行模式）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:119
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:120
#: 079da9d997bb4a9e921ddf42161bf698 9cf8c01b1a1b4b9986e5ab2cb92a0fdb
#: cd04d274b8414f4bb5e84110bff58756
msgid ""
"Note: there are equivalent \"Warn\" parameters (i.e. AVD_W_DIST_XY) that can"
" be used to adjust when warnings to the pilot will appear on the ground "
"station."
msgstr "注意：还有等效的「Warn」参数（如 AVD_W_DIST_XY），可用于调整地面站向飞手发出警告的时机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:121
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:122
#: 54238b3bd9c4459fbdf1405aa471cbfe 55b38d73193e4e18b38176b6fb4780f0
#: 7bf30d0cded145d99180f21a586e1a4d
msgid ""
"In ArduPilot firmware versions 4.0 and later, the entry into this mode can "
"be enabled or disabled via an RC channel switch by setting the channel's "
"RCx_OPTION = 38 (ADSB Avoidance En). If the RC PWM is >1800us, then entry "
"into this mode is enabled if a threat presents."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 固件 4.0 及更高版本中，可通过 RC 通道开关（设置通道 RCx_OPTION = 38，即 ADSB Avoidance "
"En）来启用或禁用进入该模式。若 RC PWM > 1800us，则在出现威胁时启用进入该模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:128
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:129
#: 2a19b494478d489ca31c3b9dd05918b0 a0bec660fea74fe28e692e0d17d17160
#: b51858c3753c43098390f5be5ae8f6a8
msgid "Vehicle Database"
msgstr "飞行器数据库"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:130
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:131
#: 1bf9476cc1094aa99e76a8784ad0b774 d2e71943a6634584853064141b333bf4
#: f639103b3aca49179693f8f454f0b39d
msgid ""
"When enabled, the ADS-B library will store information for up to 50 vehicles"
" detected by the ADS-B receiver but can be further limited using the "
":ref:`ADSB_LIST_MAX<ADSB_LIST_MAX>` parameter. Due to some experimental work"
" in other features, such as EKF2, available RAM may be limited. It is "
"important to note that when ADS-B is disabled (:ref:`ADSB_TYPE<ADSB_TYPE>` ="
" 0) then the memory is released, effectively freeing up about 1KB of RAM. "
"When enabled, the detected vehicle list is checked once per second for "
"potential conflicts."
msgstr ""
"启用后，ADS-B 库最多可存储 50 架由 ADS-B 接收机探测到的飞行器信息，但可通过 "
":ref:`ADSB_LIST_MAX<ADSB_LIST_MAX>` 参数进一步限制。由于 EKF2 等实验性功能的开发，可用 RAM "
"可能有限。需注意的是，禁用 ADS-B（:ref:`ADSB_TYPE<ADSB_TYPE>` = 0）后内存将被释放，约释放 1KB "
"RAM。启用后，探测到的飞行器列表每秒检查一次是否存在潜在冲突。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:135
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:136
#: 674c75d63d7046e5a2ec6cbfd3b5bcf5 a639220364a04a88b4b3f7397adb83a1
#: f2aeb7b6854a4feeb21eb1fcff59433c
msgid "Developer information including Simulation"
msgstr "开发者信息（含仿真）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:136
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:137
#: 6a0713a30c0b438f84999d0d615f22ce 8d1bbbf9b70647f2b45c28bf3aca75cb
#: a2a31b38aa6a404a9a8b35a3bba84465
msgid ""
"The data is transmitted via the `ADSB_VEHICLE message "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ADSB_VEHICLE>`__. When received "
"by ArduPilot, it is streamed out using the ``SRx_ADSB`` value where x is the"
" telemetry port number and the value is how many vehicles per second to be "
"streamed. If using telem1 the streamrate param would be ``SR1_ADSB``. The "
"list will not repeat any faster than 1 second. This flexibility is useful to"
" conserve bandwidth on data links but also allow maximum update rate for "
"high-speed links such as an on-board companion computer."
msgstr ""
"数据通过 `ADSB_VEHICLE 消息 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ADSB_VEHICLE>`__ 传输。ArduPilot "
"收到后，使用 ``SRx_ADSB`` 值流式发送，其中 x 为数传端口号，值为每秒流式发送的飞行器数量。若使用 telem1，流速参数为 "
"``SR1_ADSB``。列表重复发送速率不超过每秒一次。这种灵活性有助于节省数据链路带宽，同时允许高速链路（如机载伴飞计算机）实现最高更新速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:142
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:143
#: 457257cb4b5a48e88786a9784450e417 729fb729809047ce92ca530d34d969a7
#: 79c61532d2b048b8b7acbaf9f65b1208
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's SITL includes the simulation of ADS-B enabled aircraft. To "
"enable this you must have pymavlink v1.1.70 or greater. If you have an older"
" version, use:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 的 SITL 包含 ADS-B 使能飞行器的仿真。要启用此功能，需要 pymavlink v1.1.70 "
"或更高版本。若版本较旧，请使用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:150
#: 85262fa385674768bd5ed4104523dd58
msgid ""
"Set the number of aircraft to simulate using the ``SIM_ADSB_COUNT`` "
"parameter. Ping2020 simulation support can be enabled by setting parameter "
"`'SIM_ADSB_TX``. Other simulation options for ADS-B are present, all "
"starting with ``SIM_ADSB_``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``SIM_ADSB_COUNT`` 参数设置仿真飞行器数量。通过设置参数 ``. Other simulation options for "
"ADS-B are present, all starting with `` 可启用 Ping2020 仿真支持。其他 ADS-B 仿真选项均以 "
"``SIM_ADSB_`` 开头。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:154
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:155
#: 5bd633dac57d4d6fa1e267ef69d472ab d8df4c35f87847eebc95f3063366ef40
#: e10863c76db94c5d81cc225ca04a9ace
msgid ""
"Plugging in a hardware ADS-B receiver to your computer using a USB-to-Serial"
" converter, or using the PingUSB, will allow you to overlay real ADS-B "
"traffic into the simulation.  You might invoke SITL in this way to achieve "
"this effect:"
msgstr ""
"通过 USB 转串口转换器将硬件 ADS-B 接收机连接至计算机，或使用 PingUSB，可将真实 ADS-B 流量叠加到仿真中。可通过以下方式调用 "
"SITL 实现此效果："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:161
#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:162
#: bf2a9e532e1047e89637fef8a3a4bed7 d16e7ab3060440cb8d00803436ed990b
#: f642490efb764dbf9a4ab2ab3845ac17
msgid ""
"Where SERIAL_DEVICE might be /dev/serial/by-id/usb-"
"FTDI_FT232R_USB_UART_A4008ZND-if00-port0 on a Linux system (find a list of "
"valid serial devices with the command ``ls /dev/serial/by-id/*`` or ``ls "
"/dev/ttyS*`` for a COM port on Cygwin).  Once SITL has started it may be "
"necessary to set the ``SERIAL3_`` parameters:"
msgstr ""
"其中 SERIAL_DEVICE 在 Linux 系统上可能为 /dev/serial/by-id/usb-"
"FTDI_FT232R_USB_UART_A4008ZND-if00-port0（使用命令 ``ls /dev/serial/by-id/*`` 或 "
"Cygwin 上 ``ls /dev/ttyS*`` 查找有效串口设备列表）。SITL 启动后可能需要设置 ``SERIAL3_`` 参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:28
#: 4b00193605164e568b2b379484bf4f11 b5e670fcce1b49ca94fadfec436e1556
msgid ""
"`SoftRF Nano Edition <https://github.com/lyusupov/SoftRF/wiki/Nano-"
"Edition>`__ uses `RadioMaster® XR1 "
"<https://radiomasterrc.com/products/xr1-nano-multi-frequency-expresslrs-"
"receiver>`__ ELRS receiver hardware (10+ USD) to display FLARM AIR V7, "
"OGNTP, P3I, FANET+ or SRD 860 / ADS-L instead of ADS-B data"
msgstr ""
"`SoftRF Nano Edition <https://github.com/lyusupov/SoftRF/wiki/Nano-"
"Edition>`__ 使用 `RadioMaster® XR1 "
"<https://radiomasterrc.com/products/xr1-nano-multi-frequency-expresslrs-"
"receiver>`__ ELRS 接收机硬件（10 美元以上）来显示 FLARM AIR V7、OGNTP、P3I、FANET+ 或 SRD 860 "
"/ ADS-L，而非 ADS-B 数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ads-b-receiver.rst:151
#: 0099d98a0830488da1aa6c8da48031f3 d048972aba144f87ad4434e6e2505671
msgid ""
"Set the number of aircraft to simulate using the ``SIM_ADSB_COUNT`` "
"parameter. Ping2020 simulation support can be enabled by setting parameter "
":ref:`SIM_ADSB_TX <SIM_ADSB_TX>`. Other simulation options for ADS-B are "
"present, all starting with ``SIM_ADSB_``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``SIM_ADSB_COUNT`` 参数设置要仿真的飞机数量。设置参数 :ref:`SIM_ADSB_TX <SIM_ADSB_TX>` 可启用"
" Ping2020 仿真支持。ADS-B 还有其他仿真选项，均以 ``SIM_ADSB_`` 开头。"
